### Top-level file directly under media/
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=photo-1.jpg

### File nested in a media subfolder (.migration/media/abcd/photo-3.jpg)
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=photo-3.jpg

### Small variant file
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=photo-2-small.jpg

### Video file
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=demo.mp4

### Poster image
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=demo-poster.jpg

### Missing media param -> 404 JSON error
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load

### Unknown file name -> 404 JSON error
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=does-not-exist.jpg

### Path traversal attempt -> rejected
GET http://localhost:4000/media-load?media=..%2F..%2Fpackage.json
